{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_08_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2d6ef78177ee9491c50846307bd95393888dd4e7e64de98ddbf62cbb4a0bab31",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd27a857a4773aefe98073ed4735865091fcbbe909c85a35eb4c95d252a3f74",
      "text": "“力量微笑LIVE”当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6274bd97051ad2a203b67b780baaeafde9aa52538210f35437b0d32c36547ffe",
      "text": "座位请往这边走。如果有任何问题，\n请随时告知附近的工作人员！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d3ffad27d2ecab303ade39c762303323412e7eeb5dca1442e51827d430cec5e",
      "text": "怎么啦？啊，摔倒受伤了吗！\n没事，和大哥哥一起去休息室吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:145f6edd19b13d14f61bc950dda7e67e9f34b22b6d461fb2288c78df026d5861",
      "text": "非常感谢您今天光临现场。\n好的，洗手间在这边。我来为您带路！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f6d1e1723e4b0a89d49c956799ff65477639e483045f3cf39c42f0a2f945fae",
      "text": "（偶像和工作人员全都通力合作，\n负责着舞台的接待和引导观众……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4cad01419aa4fd8dd4faa102ac0fcd663c0d4f336ba6279be6638a721956a4c",
      "text": "（照这样下去，应该能顺利举办演出了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6560c894283b692cf72e00a589433a2c2367f2c51b8ebdee9269d5bff6996a40",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，不好意思。\n你在哪里看到龙了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb95628ca72d48087cfa7c014d532f2eb9485bda13a64d752b75abf721aaa27a",
      "text": "龙先生的话，\n去对面的停车场迎接观众了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ac3f2e4dd1c4a1ae3b839f9473e70b555b0a67280786a67bb074e28260b3147",
      "text": "这样啊，有点事要确认，我正在找他。\n电话也打不通。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa2ebabe01a5af5a51f9242d2e6ffdf524c05e84f918a8ea019c800ddb7b3ee2",
      "text": "不知道是信号不好，\n还是倒霉遇到了故障……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:095f35c0f0d916aa0ed288ae4d0f94992f05cfb501c070fb1144ca94d434b0b7",
      "text": "确实有可能是\n又卷进了什么倒霉事里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52421bd17dcae3185be0cd02f6d0087e9f4fabc2186338669647c923be5c08e9",
      "text": "要不换●●●●プロデューサー试试，\n给他联络一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:955fa925aea2272d98a52c72c69f50afad1fcd958813a4689a948c0e1cc641d3",
      "text": "啊，是龙先生打来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b709ea6bf3f94a8bd9eabb51a00d7b9eddb951833e3c73de8c4bfdb722160179",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！？太好了，\n刚才手机突然出毛病吓死我了，总算打通了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee2ae39f36b7abd39fc18feb8858bed92ef5c591a7f502d1b657f8e5ec7304f",
      "text": "这么忙的时候打电话，对不起！其实啊，我到了\n停车场这边，但是看不到客人们的人影。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b729255754c54fa2cb0063089a9311bd38613a82e3ede1d638a1a1bb3fc59553",
      "text": "明明是顺着作为路标的路锥走过来的，真奇怪啊。\n……咦？那边也有路锥。那边也有？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d25cb5adc0340f90b97981381ffc327f63af1f6611144f93ec64997bcf2e9a16",
      "text": "难道说，位置被挪动过了！？\n呜呜。又是我平时的倒霉毛病犯了吗～～！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000129:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a212b45a7c854dd46cad38421f2c618e852be6fcc8a30dca95bb4fdc5fc2a832",
      "text": "周围有些什么\n东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000132:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8c7e72e4c7d3a1e80b08c1f9446f582db62cd5cc90cc2d1c6d6af3ac7145906",
      "text": "哎？能看到厕所什么的，\n还有一栋红屋顶的建筑物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000134:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9512a02aabe9852d8e86b90755f123ad23a9a1f37f2732c37c74a6622155acd9",
      "text": "请试着往那栋\n红色的建筑物走！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000137:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b82846c6a2bb36e1a5718268d6547f83021c0255caec47212533400108e2d855",
      "text": "知道了！……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000139:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b44fb6437724ca3a01cee9376ef519d87623251d7aff75aa28e18058f39a11f",
      "text": "啊，那群人……是客人们！\n太好了，总算会合了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_08:1_4_002_08_g:cmd-000141:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc1375e05cfbf18c02976e64f9ca89fb1fd740c55a912e610d173b183612c2f6",
      "text": "谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我马上带大家往那边走！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
